ETHICAL USE NOTICE
This software performs facial identification for demonstration and educational
purposes. Do not use it for surveillance, law enforcement, access control,
employment, or any other high-impact decision without appropriate legal basis,
consent, and safeguards. The bundled demo faces are AI-generated fictional
people; the project ships no photographs of real individuals.
